id=\"note_0459005\">不應【大】，終不【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0459006\">〔命〕－【宋】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0459006\">命【大】，〔－〕【宋】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0459007\">梨＝黎【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0459007\">梨【大】，黎【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0459008\">不＋（者）【宋】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0459008\">不【大】，不者【宋】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0459009\">時我＝我時【三】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0459009\">時我【大】，我時【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0460001\">要＝即【三】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0460001\">要【大】，即【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0460002\">〔便〕－【宋】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0460002\">便【大】，〔－〕【宋】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0460003\">業＝我【元】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0460003\">業【大】，我【元】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0460004\">焦＝樵【三】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0460004\">焦【大】，樵【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0460005\">狸＝子【三】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0460005\">狸【大】，子【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0460006\">上＝尚【三】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0460006\">上【大】，尚【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0460007\">根＝法【三】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0460007\">根【大】，法【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0460008\">壙＝矌【三】【宮】＊</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0460008\">壙【大】＊，矌【宋】【元】【明】【宮】＊</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0460009\">樹＝林【三】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0460009\">樹【大】，林【宋】【元】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0460010\">林＝樹【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0460010\">林【大】，樹【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0460011\">咎＝答【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0460011\">咎【大】，答【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0460012\">令＝今【元】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0460012\">令【大】，今【元】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0460013\">犍＝揵【三】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0460013\">犍【大】，揵【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0461001\">㖒＝洟【宋】【元】，涕【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0461001\">㖒【大】，洟【宋】【元】，涕【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0461002\">〔多〕－【宋】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0461002\">多【大】，〔－〕【宋】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0461003\">〔者〕－【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0461003\">者【大】，〔－〕【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0461004\">〔家〕－【三】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0461004\">家【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0461005\">融＝鎔【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0461005\">融【大】，鎔【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0461006\">消＝銷【三】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0461006\">消【大】，銷【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0461007\">法＝故【三】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0461007\">法【大】，故【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0461008\">法＋（故）【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0461008\">法【大】，法故【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0461009\">〔是〕－【三】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0461009\">是【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0462001\">法＝物【三】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0462001\">法【大】，物【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0462002\">褐＝毼【三】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0462002\">褐【大】，毼【宋】【元】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0462003\">草＝果【三】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0462003\">草【大】，果【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0462004\">狗鷄＝鷄狗【三】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0462004\">狗鷄【大】，鷄狗【宋】【元】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0462005\">〔邪〕－【宋】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0462005\">邪【大】，〔－〕【宋】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0462006\">信心＝心信【宋】【元】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0462006\">信心【大】，心信【宋】【元】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0462007\">諸＝謂【三】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0462007\">諸【大】，謂【宋】【元】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0462008\">見＝是【三】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0462008\">見【大】，是【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0462009\">杖＝打【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0462009\">杖【大】，打【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0462010\">知而不見＝為知【三】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0462010\">知而不見【大】，為知【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0462011\">𭃓＝瓮【元】，甕【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0462011\">瓫【CB】【麗-CB】，𭃓【大】，瓮【元】，甕【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0462012\">不分卷及品【三】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0462012\">不分卷及品【宋】【元】【明】</div></div>"
